+- Ticket display code now carries the priority level and restarts daily: default prefixes `N` (Normal, `0`), `P` (Priority, `10`), `E` (80+, `20`) with range fallback, per-queue nullable `queues.priority_prefix_map` override (`Queue::prefixForPriority()`, `Queue::defaultPrefixFor()`, `Queue::DEFAULT_PREFIX_MAP`), daily `tickets.issue_date` (`DATE NOT NULL`, cast to `date`) and unique `(queue_id, code, issue_date)`. Issuance (`IssueTicket`) uses one clock read for code day/`issued_at`/`issue_date` with independent per-prefix sequences; factory aligns `issue_date` to `issued_at` and allocates by priority/day; `UpdateQueue` gains `priorityPrefixMap` (`null` keep, `[]` clear, invalid -> `ValidationException`).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
